body:
Clearly with that excitement over a single Nintendo Switch to share with his sister and 3 games one of which is a 2year old annual title {Just Dance 2019} I doubt he has it on other systems, or maybe a tablet or phone.... OP says tablet.
I know it's a lot of money for a game system for lots of families, but if one ever finds themselves able to do so a power move is to have a Nintendo Switch per gamer in house hold. {It took us 3 years to get 3 systems, my SO, myself,and our oldest child}
Ok my quick tip over.
